        "Add foreign keys with appropriate cascade behavior",
        "Add indexes on brand_id and product_id",
        "Enable RLS: users can access personas of their own brands",
        "Migration runs successfully",
        "Typecheck passes"
      ],
      "priority": 4,
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Migration at supabase/migrations/20260126000004_create_personas_table.sql with all required columns (id UUID PK, brand_id UUID FK, product_id UUID FK nullable, intelligence_report_id UUID FK nullable, name VARCHAR 100, photo_prompt TEXT, photo_url VARCHAR 500, backstory TEXT, quote VARCHAR 500, day_in_life TEXT, demographics/professional/psychographics/lifestyle/media_tech/buying_behavior JSONB, beliefs_attitudes JSONB nullable, generation_model VARCHAR 100 default 'claude-haiku-4-5', generation_params JSONB, validation_status VARCHAR 20 default 'pending', validation_notes TEXT, timestamps). Foreign keys: brand_id ON DELETE CASCADE, product_id/intelligence_report_id ON DELETE SET NULL. Indexes on brand_id and product_id. RLS policies for SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE through brands ownership check. Updated_at trigger."
    },
