        "Typecheck passes"
      ],
      "priority": 9,
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Migration at supabase/migrations/20260126000009_create_storage_buckets.sql. Created 5 buckets: brand-assets (5MB, images), product-images (10MB, images), persona-photos (10MB, images), creatives (100MB, images+videos), exports (50MB, json/csv/pdf/zip). All buckets are private with RLS policies for SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE using auth.uid()::text = (storage.foldername(name))[1] pattern. Uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING for idempotency."
